 2. searchNode - Get Node Templates
**When to use:** Whenever you need to create workflows, check nodes, understand how to use nodes, or verify node versions.
**DataBase tructer**
  node_Name (Name of the node).
  operator  (the node job).
  jsonCode (Example of newes version of the node).
