### Common Nodes

**Trigger Nodes (start workflow):**
- `Manual Trigger` - Manual activation
- `Schedule Trigger` - Time-based activation
- `Webhook` - Receive external requests

**Logic & Data Nodes:**
- `HTTP Request` - Call APIs
- `If` (v2.2) - Conditional branching (2 outputs)
- `Switch` (v3.3) - Multiple conditions
- `Set` - Assign/create data
- `Aggregate` - Group data
- `Wait` - Pause execution
- `Code` - Use javascript in n8n

**AI Nodes:**
- `AI Agent` - Handle AI logic
- `OpenAI Chat Model` - LLM model

**File Nodes:**
- `Extract From File` - Extract from files
- `Convert to File` - Convert to files

**Response Node:**
- `Respond to Webhook` - Send response if use webhook 
- `Gmail` - Send respond to gmail
